":"FAQ: Style & Gifts","heading_size":"h3","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"","text_size":"text-base","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"btn--primary","column_gap":"large","row_gap":"inherit","item_style":"card","item_color_scheme":"","item_heading_font":"heading","item_heading_size":"h5","item_icon_size":"extra-medium","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"featured_collection_JerEtT":{"type":"featured-collection","name":"t:sections.featured-collection.presets.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-9","header_layout":"vertical","heading":"Facial Treatments","heading_size":"h2","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"<p>Give Mum the gift of glowing, revitalised skin this Mother’s Day with our premium facial treatment experiences. From transformative 3-Month Skin Journeys to targeted LED Super Boost sessions and expert deep cleanse facials, each treatment is designed to rejuvenate, restore and renew. Indulgent, professional and utterly relaxing, these are Mother’s Day gifts she will truly remember.<\/p>","text_size":"text-base","show_collection_description":false,"collection":"mothers-day-facial-treatments","limit":8,"columns":4,"column_gap":"medium","row_gap":"inherit","grid_layout":"standard","enable_slider":true,"controls_position":"inside","pcard_image_ratio":"1\/1","columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":true,"show_all_button_on_top":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"btn--primary","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":70,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"rich_text_DDp4xi":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"button_ThfEq3":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"VIEW MORE","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/skin","button_style":"btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["button_ThfEq3"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-9","content_alignment":"center","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"collapsible_tabs_AE4pTA":{"type":"collapsible-tabs","blocks":{"collapsible_item_LqhpQ6":{"type":"collapsible_item","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What facial treatments can I gift for Mother’s Day?","content":"<p>ONLYDELUXE offers a range of facial treatment gifts including the Deluxe Skin 3 Month Journey (Rejuvenation or Anti-Aging with YAG), LED Super Boost Treatment, Hydra Pen Hydraglow, and Dr Grandel Deep Cleanse and Collagen Facials. Each can be purchased as a gift and redeemed at Mum’s convenience.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","open":false}},"collapsible_item_xD7k3y":{"type":"collapsible_item","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What is the Deluxe Skin Journey?","content":"<p>The Deluxe Skin Journey is a personalised 3-month facial programme designed to deliver visible, lasting skin results. Available in Rejuvenation and Anti-Aging with YAG variants, it is one of our most popular and results-driven gift options for Mother’s Day.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","open":false}}},"block_order":["collapsible_item_LqhpQ6","collapsible_item_xD7k3y"],"name":"t:sections.collapsible-tabs.presets.name","settings":{"container":"fixed","color_scheme":"","header_layout":"vertical","heading":"FAQ: Facial Treatments","heading_size":"h3","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"","text_size":"text-base","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"btn--primary","column_gap":"large","row_gap":"inherit","item_style":"card","item_color_scheme":"","item_heading_font":"heading","item_heading_size":"h5","item_icon_size":"extra-medium","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"featured_collection_c7jyVE":{"type":"featured-collection","name":"t:sections.featured-collection.presets.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-9","header_layout":"vertical","heading":"Nail Treatments","heading_size":"h2","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"<p>Pamper Mum with a luxurious nail treatment she will absolutely love this Mother’s Day. Whether she prefers a classic manicure, a full pedicure experience, or an indulgent combination of both, our skilled nail technicians deliver beautiful results every time. Make it extra special with our exclusive Mother and Daughter Mani\/Pedi duo, a shared pampering experience she will treasure long after the day is done.<\/p>","text_size":"text-base","show_collection_description":false,"collection":"mothers-day-nail-treatments","limit":8,"columns":4,"column_gap":"medium","row_gap":"inherit","grid_layout":"standard","enable_slider":true,"controls_position":"inside","pcard_image_ratio":"1\/1","columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":true,"show_all_button_on_top":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"btn--primary","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":70,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"rich_text_aGQebV":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"button_qUJDL7":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"VIEW MORE","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/manicure-pedicure","button_style":"btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["button_qUJDL7"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-9","content_alignment":"center","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"collapsible_tabs_WFqj8m":{"type":"collapsible-tabs","blocks":{"collapsible_item_e6UyJh":{"type":"collapsible_item","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What nail treatments does ONLYDELUXE offer for Mother’s Day?","content":"<p>We offer a full menu of nail treatments perfect for gifting, from our Caviar and Champagne Manicure and Pedicure to the Gel Fire and Ice Manicure, Deluxe Express Manicure, and Gel Overlay on Natural Nail. For something truly special, our Mother and Daughter Mani\/Pedi is a shared experience designed for mums and daughters to enjoy together.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","open":false}},"collapsible_item_yqM4wn":{"type":"collapsible_item","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What is the Mother and Daughter Mani\/Pedi experience?","content":"<p>The Mother and Daughter Mani\/Pedi is an exclusive duo nail treatment where Mum and daughter are pampered side by side. Available as a Manicure Duo, Pedicure Duo, or Full Set combining both, it is the perfect way to celebrate Mother’s Day with quality time and luxurious care.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","open":false}}},"block_order":["collapsible_item_e6UyJh","collapsible_item_yqM4wn"],"name":"t:sections.collapsible-tabs.presets.name","settings":{"container":"fixed","color_scheme":"","header_layout":"vertical","heading":"FAQ: Nail Treatments","heading_size":"h3","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"","text_size":"text-base","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"btn--primary","column_gap":"large","row_gap":"inherit","item_style":"card","item_color_scheme":"","item_heading_font":"heading","item_heading_size":"h5","item_icon_size":"extra-medium","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"featured_collection_J4n8c8":{"type":"featured-collection","name":"t:sections.featured-collection.presets.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-9","header_layout":"vertical","heading":"Skincare Products","heading_size":"h2","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"<p>Spoil Mum with a premium skincare gift she will reach for every single day. Our carefully curated selection of professional-grade skincare products, from broad-spectrum SPF protection to nourishing ampoules and targeted treatment kits, makes it effortless to find something truly thoughtful. Give her skincare that works as hard as she does this Mother’s Day.<\/p>","text_size":"text-base","show_collection_description":false,"collection":"mothers-day-skincare-products","limit":8,"columns":4,"column_gap":"medium","row_gap":"inherit","grid_layout":"standard","enable_slider":true,"controls_position":"inside","pcard_image_ratio":"1\/1","columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":true,"show_all_button_on_top":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"btn--primary","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":70,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"rich_text_nnGhB7":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"button_qwLNCH":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"VIEW MORE","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/skincare-products","button_style":"btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["button_qwLNCH"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-9","content_alignment":"center","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"featured_collection_UB9Jib":{"type":"featured-collection","name":"t:sections.featured-collection.presets.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-9","header_layout":"vertical","heading":"Ampoules","heading_size":"h2","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"","text_size":"text-base","show_collection_description":false,"collection":"mothers-day-ampoules","limit":8,"columns":3,"column_gap":"medium","row_gap":"inherit","grid_layout":"standard","enable_slider":true,"controls_position":"inside","pcard_image_ratio":"1\/1","columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":true,"show_all_button_on_top":false,"button_label":"","button_style":"btn--primary","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":70,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"rich_text_6NYXqj":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"button_48DY8V":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"VIEW MORE","button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/ampoules","button_style":"btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["button_48DY8V"],"name":"t:sections.rich-text.presets.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-9","content_alignment":"center","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"collapsible_tabs_VV3HVy":{"type":"collapsible-tabs","blocks":{"collapsible_item_TFh8qp":{"type":"collapsible_item","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"What skincare products make a good Mother’s Day gift?","content":"<p>ONLYDELUXE stocks a professional-grade skincare range including Heliocare SPF products, Nimue Starter Kits for specific skin concerns such as hyperpigmentation and problematic skin, the QMS Collagen and Exfoliant Set, and Dr. Grandel ampoules. These are gifts Mum will use and appreciate every single day.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","open":false}},"collapsible_item_yAjggn":{"type":"collapsible_item","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Are the skincare products at ONLYDELUXE suitable for sensitive skin?","content":"<p>Yes. We carry formulations suited to a variety of skin types, including the QMS Collagen Set for sensitive skin and the Nimue Purifier Kit for problematic skin. If you are unsure which product best suits Mum’s skin type, our team is happy to advise.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","open":false}}},"block_order":["collapsible_item_TFh8qp","collapsible_item_yAjggn"],"name":"t:sections.collapsible-tabs.presets.name","settings":{"container":"fixed","color_scheme":"","header_layout":"vertical","heading":"FAQ: Skincare Products","heading_size":"h3","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"","text_size":"text-base","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"btn--primary","column_gap":"large","row_gap":"inherit","item_style":"card","item_color_scheme":"","item_heading_font":"heading","item_heading_size":"h5","item_icon_size":"extra-medium","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"featured_collection_eY99Et":{"type":"featured-collection","name":"t:sections.featured-collection.presets.name","se