se}},"collapsible_item_6mCEbQ":{"type":"collapsible_item","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"Are professional hair care products a good Mother’s Day gift?","content":"<p>They make an excellent gift — practical, luxurious, and something Mum will use every single day. A professional shampoo, conditioner, or treatment mask from a brand like Kérastase or Moroccanoil is a meaningful step up from high-street alternatives.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","open":false}}},"block_order":["collapsible_item_4fLTM8","collapsible_item_6mCEbQ"],"name":"t:sections.collapsible-tabs.presets.name","settings":{"container":"fixed","color_scheme":"","header_layout":"vertical","heading":"FAQ: Hair Care Products","heading_size":"h3","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"","text_size":"text-base","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_style":"btn--primary","column_gap":"large","row_gap":"inherit","item_style":"card","item_color_scheme":"","item_heading_font":"heading","item_heading_size":"h5","item_icon_size":"extra-medium","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed","custom_class":""}},"featured_collection_JwCawE":{"type":"featured-collection","name":"t:sections.featured-collection.presets.name","settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-9","header_layout":"vertical","heading":"Gift Cards","heading_size":"h2","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"<p>Not sure what to choose? Let Mum pick her own treat with an OnlyDeluxe gift card or curated Mother’s Day bundle. Whether she has her eye on a luxurious facial treatment, a favourite skincare product, or something entirely new, our gift cards and gift bundles give her the freedom to choose exactly what she loves.<\/p>","text_size":"text-base","show_collection_description":false,"collection":"mothers-day-gift-cards","limit":8,"columns":2,"column_gap":"medium","row_gap":"inherit","grid_layout":"standard","enable_slider":false,"controls_position":"ins